						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"startedBy\": \"Installation Team\",\n  \"startedAt\": \"2025-05-28T10:30:00.000Z\",\n  \"currentStage\": \"Wall Panel Installation\",\n  \"completionPct\": 80,\n  \"expectedCompletion\": \"2025-06-08\",\n  \"notes\": \"Installation is proceeding as per schedule.\"\n}"
						}
					},
					"_postman_note": "stepKey is now one of the 21 granular lifecycle stages (see LIFECYCLE_STAGES), not the old 5-bucket keys (design/fabrication/dispatch/install/complete) \u2014 those old keys are now rejected with a 400. projectSteps now has 21 individual entries (one per granular sales+plant lifecycle stage: initial_contact -> ... -> delivered) instead of 5 collapsed buckets (Design/Fabrication/Dispatch/Install/Complete) \u2014 matches the Plant Panel's stage-by-stage tracking 1:1. Each stage key is now one of: initial_contact, requirements_gathered, proposal_sent, negotiation, deal_closed, payment_done, converted_to_po, sent_to_admin, released_to_plant, drawings_received, bom_received, bom_review, material_check, production_planning, fabrication_started, quality_inspection, packing_bundling, shipper_prepared, ready_for_delivery, dispatched, delivered."
				},
